  "findings": [
    "Complete diamond PROJECT/gold DOLLAR/emerald-bag brand and one research subtitle fit cleanly above the league header.",
    "Official vector NFL/AFC/NFC marks and local team badges remain sharp, proportionate and painted in native initial and post-regression captures.",
    "Gold/brushed-metal chamfer hardware, layered cyan/electric-blue rails, crisp faceted diamonds and narrow star glints replace the flat rounded draft treatment and materially match the approved lighting hierarchy.",
    "Native-resolution decorative helmet pair and blue stadium provide the large cinematic matchup composition. Genuine marks are independent overlays; metallic VS and gold/ice team names remain readable.",
    "Compact aligned standings, highlighted Steelers summary, three dense leader panels, tabs/selectors, and navigation preserve the approved tall screen hierarchy inside the restrained shared phone enclosure.",
    "Actual scroll views show all rank-five and touchdown glyphs clear; all 24 fresh native glyph probes reported zero ornament-obscured glyph pixels.",
    "The WebKit-only exterior upper-left corner patch and bright arc are absent after the page-local opaque mask. Untouched first and later native screenshots retain the glow, shell geometry and all true marks.",
    "Previously misleading viewer previews with blank SVG marks resolve when opening byte-identical SHA-named PNG aliases; actual current image bytes show painted marks. No persistent runtime image-loading defect remains established."
  ],
